# Three deliberate cases, so ModuleDiscoveryTest exercises a real ServiceLoader rather than a stand-in
# for one. Only the first of these can be built; the other two are the two ways a service entry goes
# wrong on somebody's server, and discovery has to survive both.
de.raindancer.modules.api.discovered.GoodModule
de.raindancer.modules.api.discovered.ExplodingModule
de.raindancer.modules.api.discovered.ModuleThatWasRenamedAndNobodyUpdatedThisFile
